# Added 2026-09-23, with the first world payload (flyDiy/media/world/jolene).
#
# git's own heuristic (a NUL byte in the first 8 KB) has carried the 264 MB of
# flyDiy/media/ so far, and core.autocrlf is false in this checkout. Neither is
# a guarantee: autocrlf is a per-clone setting, a cloud runner or a fresh clone
# on another machine may well have it on, and a gzip stream whose 0x0a bytes get
# rewritten is corrupt in a way that surfaces only as an opaque
# DecompressionStream failure at boot, a long way from the cause.
#
# So the shipped asset store is declared binary outright.
flyDiy/media/** -text
*.bin binary
